<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French first</p>
<p>division after Friday's matches:</p>
<p>17 - Stephane Guivarc'h (Rennes)</p>
<p>14 - Japhet N'Doram (Nantes), David Zitelli (Strasbourg)</p>
<p>12 - Anton Drobnjak (Bastia)</p>
<p>11 - Alain Caveglia (Lyon), Anderson (Monaco)</p>
<p>10 - Miladin Becanovic (Lille)</p>
<p>8 - Jean-Pierre Papin (Bordeaux), Thierry Henry (Monaco), Julio</p>
<p>Cesar Dely Valdes (Paris Saint-Germain), Victor Ikpeba (Monaco),</p>
<p>Xavier Gravelaine (Marseille)</p>
<p>7 - Jocelyn Gourvennec (Nantes), Leonardo (Paris St-Germain),</p>
<p>Robert Pires (Metz), Ludovic Giuly (Lyon), Ibrahim Bakayoko</p>
<p>(Montpellier)</p>
</text>
